    "title": "Bearcats Drop First Region Game in Overtime - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hunter Dawkins ,\n1 days ago PASCAGOULA (GG) — Attempting to win 2 region games for the first time in 9 years, the Long Beach Bearcats (4-3, 1-1) lost in overtime to the Pascagoula Panthers 17-10 Friday, October 16 at War Memorial Stadium. The Panthers (3-4, 1-1) finished with an 8-yard run from Kevin Marshall for a touchdown after Long Beach failed to convert on 4th down and one. Read full article",
